        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer has the following aura ability: &apos;Vexilla Defensor (Aura): While a friendly &lt;SHIELD HOST&gt; CORE or &lt;SHIELD HOST&gt; CHARACTER unit is within 6&quot; of this model, it has the benefits of light cover.&apos;</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
