    <profile name="Cadre Tactics (Aura)" id="6fbe-7af2-95c0-54bf" hidden="false" page="93" publicationId="1f0f-230b-a715-7d27" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly ANATHEMA PSYKANA CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Voidsheen Cloak" id="def8-d95b-4f72-5336" hidden="false" page="93" publicationId="1f0f-230b-a715-7d27" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model has a 5+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Tenacious Spirit" id="745d-71b2-0ccd-e0db" hidden="false" page="93" publicationId="1f0f-230b-a715-7d27" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Fight phase, if this model is within Engagement Range of any enemy units, it fights first that phase. In addition, if this model is destroyed in the Fight phase before it has been selected to fight in that phase, do not remove it from play - it can fight after the attacking model&apos;s unit has finished making its attacks. After resolving this model&apos;s attacks, it is then removed.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
